[{"answer":"\"Twinkle, twinkle, little star, how I wonder what you are;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/1.mp3"},{"answer":"up above the world so high, like a diamond in the sky,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/2.mp3"},{"answer":"twinkle, twinkle little star\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/3.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a little poem (song) I always say when I'm outside, and I see the stars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/4.mp3"},{"answer":"When I see the first star of the night, I always say this one:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/5.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Star light, star bright, first star I see tonight;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I wish I may; I wish I might,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/7.mp3"},{"answer":"have the wish I wish tonight\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a special thing to say about the stars?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Stars are beautiful bright spots in the sky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Stars are usually seen at night when it is dark.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/11.mp3"},{"answer":"We can't see them in the day time because the sun is so bright, the brightest star of all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I like staying up late just to look at the stars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/13.mp3"},{"answer":"One time I was outside at midnight,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and the stars seemed to sparkle and dance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/15.mp3"},{"answer":"They really did look like diamonds dancing in the sky!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/16.mp3"},{"answer":"If you watch the stars long enough, you may see a falling star or a shooting star.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I have seen both.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/18.mp3"},{"answer":"A falling star is where the star just seems to drop,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and it leaves a trail of what appears like star dust.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/20.mp3"},{"answer":"A shooting star is very beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It \"shoots\" across the sky leaving a long trail of colorful \"star dust\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Shooting stars seem to brighten up the whole sky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/23.mp3"},{"answer":"They usually seem quite close to earth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ever watched the stars and got the urge to reach out and touch them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/25.mp3"},{"answer":"or even join them in their secret dance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder what it'd be like to see a star up close.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Would it look like the moon?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe one day when I am older,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I will go up in a rocket ship and visit the dancing stars in the midnight sky!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/133-stars-in-the-midnight-sky-2019-04-07-04-23-35/30.mp3"}]
